cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "21cm-sbi-vmim: Simulation-based inference of the 21 cm signal with VMIM-learned summaries"
authors:
  - family-names: "Dehiwalage-Don"
    given-names: "Dilru"
    # orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"   # add if you have one
    affiliation: "Observatoire de Paris (LERMA/obspm)"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Dilru1/21cm-sbi-vmim"
abstract: >-
  Research code for simulation-based inference of reionization-era
  astrophysical parameters from the 21 cm signal, comparing VMIM-trained
  neural compressors against MSE and fixed summaries under varying thermal
  noise and dequantization jitter, with neural likelihood estimation and
  simulation-based calibration.
keywords:
  - 21 cm cosmology
  - simulation-based inference
  - neural likelihood estimation
  - reionization
  - VMIM
license: MIT
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-08-21"
